# CSharpier ignore (gitignore syntax). CSharpier 1.x formats XAML, csproj, props,
# and targets in addition to .cs - we keep it scoped to C# source only because
# WinUI XAML and the hand-tuned Murmur.csproj have their own conventions.

*.xaml
*.csproj
*.props
*.targets

# Defensive - never reformat generated WinUI code or designer files.
**/*.g.cs
**/*.g.i.cs
**/*.Designer.cs
**/GlobalUsings.g.cs

# The web tree has its own toolchain.
web/
